            "review_title": "Review at Bun Moc Thanh Mai",
            "review_text": "bjhsl\nHong Kong, China38 contributions\n0\nTasty noodle soup\nNov 2022\nOrdering is simple, there's one kind of noodle soup in 2 sizes. The small one is really small though, I recommend the big size. The soup itself comes with different kinds of pork sausages and balls and it's extremely delicious. A very light, but still fragrant and herbal flavour. With the soup there are additional herbs and veggies you can add to the soup. \nThe restaurant is conveniently next to the tourist market, but still full of locals eating there. Totally recommend for a cheap, quick and local breakfast or lunch.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 30, 2022",
