            "review_title": "Review at Bun Moc Thanh Mai",
            "review_text": "BL_Leo\nPetaling Jaya, Malaysia4019 contributions\n0\nGood pork pho\nApr 2020 • Family\nOur flight to Da Nang was in the afternoon, and that left us with a few hours to explore HCM City so we took taxi to this restaurant that serves pork pho near Ben Thanh market. To tell you the truth, I just Google and it pointed me to this direction. \n\nAs I walked in, the sight of bowls and bowls of semi-prepared pho got me excited. We were famished but as usual, the good bowl of pho provided the satisfaction to the tummy.. i simply added the grated yam, bean sprout, basil leaves, lime and chilly as much as I fancied to give it the oomph. \n\nYou'd get pork cake, pork ribs, pork balls and minced pork in the bowl completed with the smooth noodle and flavourful soup. \n\nWe left HCM city and headed to our intended destination for our holiday - Hoi An and Da Nang\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2020",
