            "review_text": "GourmandBC\nSingapore, Singapore277 contributions\n0\nA truly authentic Viet Breakfast - Bun Moc\nDec 2019 • Family\nI’ve been coming here for breakfast, brunch and occasionally Lunch for years. Note this place closes at 3 pm so no dinner. \nReally superb pork, pork balls and pork ribs noodles. Stunningly clear and flavourful soup and really really yummy and heart warming stuff for breakfast. One can get a v decent cup of Viet coffee here too. A block away from Cua Tay / West Gate of the main Ben Thanh market. 5/5 for food. It’s a double shop lot and really Viet type. Nearly 100% local patrons only and almost always packed. So........no way I can be biased or wrong.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2019",
