            "review_text": "Brian L\n151 contributions\n0\nVN does not only have Beef Rice noodles😅\nJan 2019 • Couples\n(Sorry for the late review)review~Used to visit this restaurant everytime I went to VN as my wife does not eat Beef. And Have recommend a lot of friends to visit it and told them there are a lot of different dishes in VN other than PHO beef.\nOn top of the Rice noodle You can find various style of pork balls as well as the famous VN pork sausage. \nThe best, I Would say, is the piece of pork (with bone) was so soft and tender and is probably started to be prepared together with the soup while we are still watching late night TV as they open at 5am everyday.\nWatch the photo and Just go and Grab a seat as they are always full and Pls remember they close at 2pm😂\nYou Will regret If You Miss it🍷\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2019",
